    "body": "With 2+ years in UI/UX design and 4+ years in graphic design, I've worked with 50+ clients across startups, agencies and NGOs. I begin with the problem: who the product is for, what they need and what should happen next. Then I shape the answer into clear flows, polished interfaces and consistent brand visuals. I also design and build responsive websites, and I use AI tools to explore ideas, prototype and iterate faster, without giving up craft."
